n, so HasExcessiveNonCreateWatchEvents becomes false and no project is dirtied; a batch overlapping only dependencies triggers invalidateNodeModulesCache while retaining the sets, so projects still see >1000 non-create events and are marked fully dirty; a batch overlapping observed state outside dependencies triggers the full invalidateCache and likewise fully dirties projects. Crucially, cache invalidation only sets cachedFile.needsReload, and queued pendingFileChanges or scheduled diagnostics/snapshot refreshes merely enqueue work; a program is actually rebuilt only when updateProgram runs CreateProgram/UpdateProgram and sets ProgramUpdateKindNewFiles/Cloned, so queued events or scheduled refreshes alone do not prove a program was rebuilt."
